{"text": " You wake up in 1,500 in a village in Flanders. The bread oven's warm, and the kitchen smells of rye and smoke. Did you know that here on up to four days in 10, eating meat is against the rules? Fridays, Lent, Advent, the church calls them fast days. Here's your plate, bread at almost every meal. Porridge, peas, and beans, beer to drink, dried fish on fast days. Most of what your family spends goes on food. 70 to 80% when the harvest fails, bread prices jump, and people go hungry. How long do you live? In England, just across the sea, a newborn could expect about 35 years, mostly because so many children died. If you made it to 30, you had a fair chance of reaching 60. So what is food to you? Fuel, enough to survive the day. Remember those fast days they come back at the end, and at sea on the longest voyages, sailors start falling apart.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 2.9, "text": " You wake up in 1,500 in a village in Flanders.", "tokens": [50364, 509, 6634, 493, 294, 502, 11, 7526, 294, 257, 7288, 294, 479, 1661, 433, 13, 50548], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15331196784973145, "compression_ratio": 1.537593984962406, "no_speech_prob": 0.008726734668016434, "words": [{"word": " You", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.12, "probability": 0.7840269207954407}, {"word": " wake", "start": 0.12, "end": 0.32, "probability": 0.9952095150947571}, {"word": " up", "start": 0.32, "end": 0.56, "probability": 0.9989701509475708}, {"word": " in", "start": 0.56, "end": 0.7, "probability": 0.9923851490020752}, {"word": " 1", "start": 0.7, "end": 0.84, "probability": 0.5998781323432922}, {"word": ",500", "start": 0.84, "end": 1.44, "probability": 0.9896176755428314}, {"word": " in", "start": 1.44, "end": 1.8, "probability": 0.9382588267326355}, {"word": " a", "start": 1.8, "end": 1.86, "probability": 0.9812488555908203}, {"word": " village", "start": 1.86, "end": 2.14, "probability": 0.9576114416122437}, {"word": " in", "start": 2.14, "end": 2.34, "p